          "short": "$\\{3,4,\\ldots,17,18\\}$",
          "worked": "The smallest and largest possible sums are\n$$\\begin{align*}X_{\\min}&=1+1+1=3\\\\X_{\\max}&=6+6+6=18.\\end{align*}$$\nEvery integer sum between these limits is possible. The range is $\\{3,4,\\ldots,17,18\\}$.",
